ness characteristic of her age."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She greatly respects and admires her mother, and her desire to help people as a Saint is also earnest."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c142319"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f27d31ee80bdb62784b0440411bd6ded7d1f592954575f31c725d2a57b79e392.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/af6e2e930d0db057f93158be0271b8f712f973c4b7cc4fac9bfa5bfff5aed42f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"アイネ・A・ロメロ","creatorId":"vndb:s21253","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21253","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21253","name":"アイネ・A・ロメロ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:98879","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c142320","characterName":"レナス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c142320"},"originalCharacterName":"レナス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Kingdom's Queen as well as the founder and Principal of the Adventurers' Academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Bearer of immense strength, she is stoic, serious, and dignified."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Brilliant as both a fighter and ruler, she's a hero who saved the world back when she was an adventurer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Treasures her daughter Alice, given to her by God, more than anything."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c142320"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/87/87909a3d65432928412d2c4d4ee473e66f19e3dc6e0d883408175478d88f5304.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/48d10ff3d53fa719d057a62619ebe77650b405cbfd899790f6e99a06b7930a0c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"御苑生 メイ","creatorId":"vndb:s278","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s278","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s278","name":"小山 さほみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:98876","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c142321","characterName":"リフル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c142321"},"originalCharacterName":"リフル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Student. Beastwoman."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Known for being gifted in using Thief skills."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Arrogant and cheeky."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a highly skilled adventurer who also works as a model. She's a charismatic influence among the girls at school."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c142321"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/72/727a90d0c8167624411311b0b69b85b6f4fc62f760d30bc49daf3acb1743e252.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fab252f309c1074888455c453c73361a72e0eb833c69b19093fe2e5e8de9c480.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"今谷 皆美","creatorId":"vndb:s648","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s648","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s648","name":"今谷 皆美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:98877","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c142322","characterName":"シンシア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c142322"},"originalCharacterName":"シンシア","characterNameSource":null,"ro